#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/blur_display.rst:4
msgid "模糊显示"
msgstr "Blurred display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/blur_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/blur_display.rst:9
msgid ""
"模糊显示模块用于对图像中检测到的对象进行模糊处理。该模块常用于隐私保护场景，如人脸模糊、车牌模糊等，通过对检测区域应用模糊效果来隐藏敏感信息。"
msgstr ""
"The blur display module is used to blur objects detected in the image.This "
"module is often used in privacy protection scenarios, such as blurred faces,"
" blurred license plates, etc., to hide sensitive information by applying "
"blur effects to the detection area."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/blur_display.rst:11
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

