msgid "**输入**：图像 + 预测结果（检测框/分割掩码等）"
msgstr ""
"**Input**: image + prediction result (detection box/segmentation mask, etc.)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/blur_display.rst:21
msgid "**输出**：模糊处理后的可视化图像"
msgstr "**Output**: blurred visualization image"

